    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2092304774813331612",
      "url": "https://x.com/gupta_abhinav_/status/2092304774813331612",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/gupta_abhinav_/status/2092304774813331612",
      "text": "We did not rush to put our results in public domain because we wanted to spend time understanding the prompting phenomenon. For the last two months, we have tried to obtain scaling laws of prompting models. We also tried to explain the phenomenon and comparison under both seen and unseen settings. These graphs make our results extremely promising!",
